727
00:34:49.601 --> 00:34:53.035
Kurasa Nick Fury baru saja membajak liburan musim panas kita.

728
00:34:53.037 --> 00:34:56.472
Saya, eh, Pak Harrington bagi anak-anak...

729
00:34:56.474 --> 00:34:58.207
- ANAK LAKI-LAKI: Oh, baiklah. - Oke.

730
00:34:58.209 --> 00:34:59.412
Luar biasa.

731
00:35:00.612 --> 00:35:03.012
Ya. Luar biasa.

732
00:35:03.014 --> 00:35:04.916
